  <prompt>Add three characterization tests that pin today's wrong owner in the #2483 window (design.md §15.1, §15.6 "042a"): A1 and A2 in RouteCreatePreCreateStampTests.cs, A3 in RecordCreationServicePipelineSeamTests.PreCreateStamp.cs. Change nothing under src/. Ship them in their own PR; 042b inverts them.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer, .NET 10 BFF test harnesses (data-mutation and seam), Dataverse ownership model.</role>
  <goal>Master holds three green tests that state, in assertions, that a create filed under a team-owned intermediate of a Secure matter is owned by the intermediate's ordinary team while the reconciler would own the written row to the Secure team.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>design.md §15 (moved from the addendum 2026-11-02), §15.11 UAC-r2 review; spec FR-41; owner decision notes/decisions.md 2026-11-02 item 3 ("a characterization test of today's window, then the fix as its own change"); DI-009; #2483. Line numbers in §15 are at 4fdb0a5c99; re-grep.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">tests/integration/data-mutation/RecordOwnership/RouteCreatePreCreateStampTests.cs (partial of SecureChildOwnershipAiToolTests; route harness, real service, StampWorld; add A1, A2)</file>
